WEBVTT

00:07:30.538 --> 00:07:34.163
But because that was my life,

00:07:34.996 --> 00:07:43.288
it wasn't really until my mother finally
escaped my dad that I realized, oh,

00:07:43.413 --> 00:07:46.579
this is what happiness is,
this is how it should be.

00:07:47.788 --> 00:07:51.954
So, yeah, I mean, I really think I
had these kind of two childhoods,

00:07:51.954 --> 00:07:56.038
really three childhoods. But the first one
was terror and darkness and violence

00:07:56.038 --> 00:08:01.954
and abuse. And the second one was my mom
is a single mom and we were very poor.